NOTICE — NON-CUSTODIAL SOFTWARE, NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE

SAGE is non-custodial. CRIPTOGRAFIA Capital never takes custody of your assets.
Funds are held solely by your own Safe multisig smart contract; agent keys are
yours, and you can always recover and operate your Safe with no vendor present.
Use of this software creates no custodial, fiduciary, advisory, or brokerage
relationship.

Distributed-ledger transactions are irreversible and may result in total loss
of funds. Nothing produced by this software is financial, investment, legal, or
tax advice. You are solely responsible for your own regulatory, KYC/AML,
sanctions, and tax obligations in your jurisdiction.

CRIPTOGRAFIA PRIVATE (the Private Agentic Crypto Bank) is a separate
proprietary commercial product and is NOT covered by this MIT license.
